{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の中川智尋です( . .)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6/10に"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single『Lonesome rabbit / What's “KAZOKU”?』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売となりました🐰👨‍👩‍👦"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもお手に取っていただきありがとうございます"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVもたくさん観てくれてありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生楽曲の「We got your back」のMVも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみにしていてください〜！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobC2JdoL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あいりさんカメラ( ᵕᴗᵕ ）"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アートワークのおしゃれなスタイリング、とってもお気に入りです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売日はSHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんに訪店させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも素敵な展示ありがとうございます！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobIBMxUl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お隣の大園さんとハート作りました( . .)♡"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見つけてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも、いま何小僧？って聞いてくださいます"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大園さん大好き小僧です〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一昨日は、「STAR」さんにて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "“Lonesome rabbit”を披露させていただきました！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobABJrd9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "的野さんとっても面白いです＾＾"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "フォーメーションがお隣で、歌割りも同じで嬉しいです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob4Y3T2W.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3人でダンスの練習たくさんしました〜！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobrxZfMK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近、4期＋キッズで“ヨンキッキーズ”と"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マネージャーさんに呼ばれています( ᯅ̈ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来週も「STAR」さんにて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "What's “KAZOKU”?の披露があります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみだね👨‍👩‍👦"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お知らせ 🗣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thSingleCD購入者スペシャル応募が始まっています！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミーグリでは、どちらも浴衣を着る予定です☺︎ 何色がいいかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今回のペアレーンミーグリは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このみとペアです😻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第1次応募は日曜日までです！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏の思い出たくさん作れたらいいな"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobFxIT59.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobW59ylj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "チョチョチョチョットだけ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見つめていたい！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}